(7533374, 1204222, 19959, '<td valign="top">Thanks to everybody for your votes and kind comments.<br/> <br/>It does seem too good to be true and the Bridge is busy this time of the morning (around 8:00am) -  I took a selection of photos on this morning and this was by far the stronger of the shots.<br/>This was not staged, I simply got lucky with the perfect subject at the perfect time - no other commuters in view and a suitably dreary morning in London :)<br/> <br/>I plan to write a blog post at the weekend with out-takes from this morning and some details around the Lensbaby Trio 28 <br/> <br/>Chris</td>', 'Thanks to everybody for your votes and kind comments. It does seem too good to be true and the Bridge is busy this time of the morning (around 8:00am) -  I took a selection of photos on this morning and this was by far the stronger of the shots.This was not staged, I simply got lucky with the perfect subject at the perfect time - no other commuters in view and a suitably dreary morning in London :) I plan to write a blog post at the weekend with out-takes from this morning and some details around the Lensbaby Trio 28  Chris', '2017-09-06 02:15:09.000000', NULL, 0),
